CD2O3A   OD31A   150.000  1.330   ! from CD2O3A OD30C  PENALTY  5.000
OD2C1A    DUMH    480.40      0.969 !from OD31F    DUMH    480.40      0.969 ! ACEH, PEML

ANGLES
