CD2O3A   OD31A   HDP1A   65.000  108.000   ! from CD2R6A OD31A HDP1A  PENALTY  7.000
CD2O3A   OD2C1A    DUMH     58.90    110.20   ! 15.10   2.3770 !from CD2O3A   OD31F    DUMH     58.90    110.20   15.10   2.3770 ! ACEH, PEML , removed UB terms

DIHEDRALS
