!CD32A   CD32A   CD33A   HDA3A   0.140  3  0.000   ! from CD32A CD32A CD33A HDA3A  PENALTY 118.000
CD32A   CD2O3A   OD31A   HDP1A   0.990  2  180.000   ! from CD2R6A CD2R6A OD31A HDP1A  PENALTY 577.000
CD2O3A   CD32A   CD32A   HDA2A   0.156  3  0.000   ! from CD2C1A CD32A CD32A HDA2A  PENALTY 63.000
OD2C1A   CD2O3A   CD32A   HDA2A   0.420  3  180.000   ! from OD2C2A CD2O2A CD32A HDA2A  PENALTY 364.000
OD2C1A   CD2O3A   OD31A   HDP1A   1.110  2  180.000   ! from OD2C3A CD2O3A OD30D HDP1A  PENALTY 814.000
